meta {
  name: Next free slot
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/queue/next?workspace_id=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  workspace_id: 
  ~account_id: 
}

tests {
  test('status is successful', function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.be.oneOf([200]);
  });
}

docs {
  The time a post added to the queue now would get. Pass `account_id` (one id, or several comma-separated) to ask for those accounts; an account with slots of its own uses only those, one without uses the workspace slots. Without it the answer is the next free occurrence of any slot.

  Requires the `posts` scope when using an API key.

  **Scope:** `posts`
}
